  "summary": "最多执行 k 次把任一元素加一，求操作后某个元素可达到的最大频数。",
  "insight": "排序后固定右端值为目标，窗口内全部提升到 nums[right] 的成本是 value*length-windowSum。用滑动窗口保持成本不超过 k。",
  "pitfalls": [
    "只能增加所以目标取窗口最大值",
    "成本使用 long",
    "排序后最优集合可取连续窗口"
  ],
  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sorted-equalization-window",
      "title": "排序等值化滑动窗口",
      "kind": "最优",
      "idea": "维护可用操作覆盖的最长目标值窗口。",
      "steps": [
        "nums 排序，left=0,sum=0",
        "right 扩张并加 nums[right]",
        "while nums[right]*(right-left+1)-sum>k，移除 nums[left++]；更新最大窗口长度"
      ],
      "complexity": {
        "time": "O(n log n)",
        "space": "O(log n)"
      },
      "files": {
        "java": "solutions/sorted-equalization-window/Solution.java",
        "kotlin": "solutions/sorted-equalization-window/Solution.kt",
        "cpp": "solutions/sorted-equalization-window/solution.cpp"
      }
    }
  ]
